1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:12,337
Writing, task one. Form number 5. You want to enrol your child in an after-school club. Answer the questions in the application. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:15,300
What does your child like doing in their free time?

3
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:30,219
My daughter likes drawing, singing and playing with friends outside at the playground.

4
00:00:31,133 --> 00:00:33,272
Why do you want to enrol your child in our club?

5
00:00:43,667 --> 00:00:48,170
I want to enrol her because she will learn new things there and make friends.

6
00:00:49,067 --> 00:00:51,140
When can your child attend the club?

7
00:01:01,533 --> 00:01:05,385
She can go on Mondays and Wednesdays after school, from three o'clock.

8
00:01:06,300 --> 00:01:15,318
Fill in form 5 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
